01:31:49.033 --> 01:31:50.033
Tempelin.

01:31:52.166 --> 01:31:53.166
Tempelin.

01:32:07.166 --> 01:32:08.833
Enak. Enak banget.

01:32:20.266 --> 01:32:22.700
Tegang banget ya.

01:32:25.566 --> 01:32:26.900
Aku bisa tahan kok.

01:32:27.500 --> 01:32:28.500
Serius?

01:32:30.100 --> 01:32:31.100
Aku mulai ya.

01:32:33.100 --> 01:32:34.333
Sini, kasih buat aku.

01:32:59.100 --> 01:32:59.800
Gila.

01:33:00.133 --> 01:33:01.133
Enak banget.

01:33:05.333 --> 01:33:06.333
Tunggu, tunggu, tunggu.

01:33:13.766 --> 01:33:14.733
Rasanya enak ya.

01:33:14.866 --> 01:33:16.966
Iya. Selalu diginiin ya?

01:33:19.800 --> 01:33:20.833
Gila.

01:33:21.800 --> 01:33:23.066
Jadi kamu suka yang begini.

01:33:24.100 --> 01:33:26.366
Ini arahnya mau ke mana sih? Parah banget ya?

01:33:33.066 --> 01:33:34.533
