Kamu mau biarin aku keluar?

01:34:01.066 --> 01:34:01.866
Mau ke mana?

01:34:02.066 --> 01:34:03.066
Mau ke mana?

01:34:04.400 --> 01:34:05.400
Aku juga ya.

01:34:05.766 --> 01:34:06.233
Gila...

01:34:06.800 --> 01:34:07.800
Enak banget.

01:34:13.766 --> 01:34:15.200
