01:34:25.833 --> 01:34:26.800
Enak banget.

01:34:26.900 --> 01:34:27.533
Enak banget.

01:34:27.700 --> 01:34:27.866
Gila...

01:34:28.200 --> 01:34:29.200
Gila...

01:34:35.533 --> 01:34:36.666
Enak banget.

01:34:58.800 --> 01:35:03.766
Enak banget.

