01:39:45.900 --> 01:39:46.900
Hebat ya.

01:39:55.700 --> 01:39:56.833
Rasanya enak banget.

01:39:58.100 --> 01:39:59.800
Ekspresi wajahmu bagus banget.

01:40:00.500 --> 01:40:01.766
Sini, hadap ke arahku.

01:40:01.966 --> 01:40:06.800
Mumpung lagi begini. Aku pengen ciuman lagi. Kamu mau?

01:40:20.066 --> 01:40:21.766
