01:40:30.233 --> 01:40:31.233
Tunggu sebentar.

01:40:34.133 --> 01:40:35.400
Nggak kuat.

01:40:35.800 --> 01:40:37.100
Nggak kuat.
Nggak kuat lagi.
Sakit.

01:40:37.233 --> 01:40:38.466
Sakit. Sakit.

01:40:39.633 --> 01:40:40.633
Ah, mau keluar.

01:40:52.033 --> 01:40:57.766
Jangan. Jangan nangis ya. Masih berasa?

01:41:00.200 --> 01:41:05.600
